                                                "sense_id": "2cfb766c-c44a-3e9d-9991-a0485bd4a5bc",
                                                "text": "[…]her own cook at South End, a young woman hired for the time, who never had been able to understand what she meant by a basin of nice smooth gruel, thin, but not too thin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cca1bef3-e6c4-40b1-99e5-b4bd5cc3d99c",
                                                "sense_id": "2cfb766c-c44a-3e9d-9991-a0485bd4a5bc",
                                                "text": "“It’s not that bad,” said Tiger defensively. “The foundlings rarely have to share blankets these days, and the gruel no longer has a consistency thinner than water."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
